# Board Game journal instructions

Read README and HANDOFF before editing. The Board Game page is now a text and
image blog matching Chord Organ, Cicadas, and Lorentz Violin. Edit index.html
directly; do not restore the game applet or use a Markdown generator. Keep newer
entries above older entries. Use the shared Chord Organ stylesheet and journal.js.
Store journal images in images/ and reference them directly; do not maintain a duplicate Pictures/ folder.
